# Ruling 2024-09-20: "A spell that can't be countered is a legal target for Fear of Impostors's last ability. The spell won't be countered
# when the ability resolves, but its controller will still manifest dread." Bot2 casts Abrupt Decay ("This spell can't be countered") at
# Bot1's Memnite on turn 2, and Bot1 flashes the Impostors in (CR 702.8a) with Black Lotus. The enters trigger targets the Decay: it stays on
# the stack (CR 701.6), Bot2 still manifests dread (Lightning Bolt face down, Mountain to the graveyard, CR 701.62a), and then the Decay
# resolves and destroys the Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Fear of Impostors
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Abrupt Decay
Island x4
Island
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x10

